  "engineSource": "https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/3.5/core/math/random_pcg.cpp",
  "rules": [
    "HP3+2 per wave, contact1+0.85 per wave, speed150+/-20px/s; HP factor1. Scene chain parent/child hurt offsets retained separately.",
    "Before450px inclusive detection: plain following. Detection adds150px/s times accessibility once and enables0.2s target-input anticipation for normal movement.",
    "Charge targets the actual current target position at START_SHOOT in both axes, without movement prediction or target RNG. The sampled vector stays locked through windup even if the target moves.",
    "Normal cooldown15frames with0jitter, windup native charge-prep fire time divided by animation speed4, rush0.3s at400px/s added to base speed, recovery0.05s, radial range0..350px.",
    "Every second SHOOT resets the shot counter and uses exact45frames long cooldown plus rush duration without a cooldown random draw. Normal rand_range still samples even for equal endpoints; engine source checked.",
    "Detection bonus is overwritten by charge_speed at SHOOT and cleared at unlock, as in original ChargingAttackBehavior; it must not be restored on every frame. Shot counter and detection latch survive live World/Charm transfer."
  ],
  "interfaces": [
    "NativeCharge.longEvery/longCooldown optional; NativeStraightCharge.State.shotsTaken persists with the existing actor state.",
    "NativeCharge.target.player distinguishes TargetType.PLAYER from absent horizontal STRAIGHT_TO_PLAYER and existing around-player targets. Around-player fields are optional in the type but asserted in that branch.",
    "detection.anticipateAfter is compiled into kind.anticipate; World applies anticipation only after detection when a latch exists. Existing actors without detection retain their anticipation.",
    "JungleWalkers/EnemyKinds activate Jeholopterus/type56. Shared source charge defaults reused by compiler. No remote/schema/Arsenal changes."
  ],
